{"unit_id":"123456robust__dsh-connect-modelscope#card-zh","repo":"123456robust/dsh-connect-modelscope","commit":"04dd157d6e7dc9be35bec70d7dc29e470eb977f6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-connect-modelscope 是 DSH Web 客户端的 ModelScope 模型接入插件。它在设置页提供配置卡片，并向 llm 服务注册 modelscope provider，自动获取聊天模型目录并补充模型元数据。用户可保存密钥、刷新目录和测试连接；目录获取失败时仍可使用内置模型列表。适合希望在 DSH 中选择 ModelScope 模型的用户。需要 ModelScope API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:34-78","lib/index.js:108-120","lib/index.js:345-387","lib/client.js:20-45"]}
